t_id":"2f41-ebda-3419-4c06"},{"link_uuid":"e0798708-9bfb-4e5c-8a77-54ecf00ae711","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"756e-261e-a974-4966"},{"link_uuid":"0a076c4c-42e8-4e84-9c26-8dcd3f195036","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"8e4c-cbf9-3a98-4171"},{"link_uuid":"2a62e39e-e761-4f77-a376-f68617d67fd2","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"8f72-7005-fb0f-47d2"},{"link_uuid":"b72e1367-f399-4768-954b-8b3f95bd8b83","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"d3e8-b16e-f0c8-4081"},{"link_uuid":"c5de27bc-9f77-420e-bacc-77f7023965f4","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"bbab-0a75-4dda-46ca"},{"link_uuid":"a380b23b-8013-4db5-8e5a-1183942e5fe7","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"b2e3-6fc8-382c-4fa3"},{"link_uuid":"ed8a0d3a-8d66-4db8-8e14-fb4db4c950ff","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"dbc7-ccb5-a979-4f82"},{"link_uuid":"73864cd4-edf3-4519-beac-62ce0d07cb81","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"7642-dc3e-bd18-4c75"},{"link_uuid":"e0641b54-b4a0-47be-b179-644f1d8b2030","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"a56a-e6c9-ffca-4664"},{"link_uuid":"12e05695-64a1-483e-b499-17f8b1a5361c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"c046-45ab-d473-4eb2"},{"link_uuid":"7e600ff8-6f7c-41c9-a91d-a81ef5c823a3","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"25c3-7613-54fe-4115"},{"link_uuid":"2478beeb-d646-4fe3-947f-34390aa51772","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"c22e-e702-9815-4610"},{"link_uuid":"0657a1a4-edee-4499-8633-98a57d821f82","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"eb08-d8c3-0bc2-476a"},{"link_uuid":"525c2b97-df91-45bf-af10-96c98dffd392","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"4072-5409-53e4-437f"},{"link_uuid":"c7767c16-5e1a-4a17-a978-2fdd0c414293","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"50d8-5019-2ff4-41f2"},{"link_uuid":"6c79c86b-b1d5-4457-b5a0-44ec1be7b9ac","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"7a1e-92d8-7e0b-4978"},{"link_uuid":"3dfcb779-05fb-40c1-87c2-7bf5ac18b010","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"f312-b496-6579-4357"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/unit cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_api_surface_gate.py:1-16` — Preserve baseline scope, drift kinds, and clean-subprocess reason. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_attest_dsse_heldout.py:1-10` — Preserve adversarial DSSE behaviors. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_attest_dsse.py:1-20` — Preserve DSSE PAE formula and observable round-trip contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_attest_opcert_heldout.py:1-19` — Preserve adversarial security matrix and storage-anchor semantics. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_attest_opcert.py:1-13` — Preserve signing subject, trust root, era, and OpenSSH requirement. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_attest_sshsig_heldout.py:1-11` — Preserve fail-closed matrix and independent signing setup. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_attestation_invalidation.py:1-17, 486-490, 515-519, 540-545, 573-576, 610-613` — Preserve overlay drift/grandfathering and gate-ref-vs-local anchor cases. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_attested_ticket_root.py:1-15` — Preserve separate code/ticket roots and context propagation requirement. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_audit_coaching_fidelity.py:1-8` — Preserve complete coaching fields and code-review parity. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_audit_code_review_v2.py:1-9` — Preserve retained buckets, verification, thresholds, and surfaced compatibility. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_audit_plan_review_v2.py:1-8` — Preserve evidence/scenarios/threshold persistence and v1 reader compatibility. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_audit_serve_heldout.py:1-15` — Preserve disabled, missing-extra, bind-warning, and loopback behaviors. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_audit_serve.py:1-17` — Preserve happy-path server/config/lazy-import behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_audit_ticket_page_heldout.py:1-8, 85-93` — Preserve DOM contract and legacy `kind` compatibility. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_audit_ticket_page.py:1-10` — Preserve rendered audit sections/content. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_authorship_batched_ticket_map_7084.py:1-14, 34-47, 62-73, 493-501, 519-534` — Preserve attribution equivalence, rendered Git diagnostics, and failure-time forensics fields. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_autodeploy_prune.py:1-16, 52-57, 155-158` — Preserve capped prune, fail-soft behavior, measurement fields, and sequenced `df` stub. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_bare_exempt_short_circuit.py:1-20, 94-100, 180-186` — Preserve derived exemption-minus-bug-tier invariant and exact membership. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_api_surface_gate.py tests/unit/test_attest_dsse_heldout.py tests/unit/t